- consider XDG paths (~/.config/{git,tmux,vim}) for the newer tools
- `rbenv global 4.0.7` if you want rbenv's ruby rather than brew's as the default
- move ~/.secrets/elanor-*.private-key.{pem,b64} into 1Password; the .b64 files
  are duplicates of the .pem ones and can go once stored
- retrieve the old GPG key from Dropbox (web UI, no app needed) if you still
  need to decrypt anything encrypted to 7DC14831
